        "Bounded by a 430 km frontier with South Africa and a 105 km border with Mozambique, Mbabane's security and trade are inextricably tied to Pretoria. Diplomatically, Eswatini's steadfast recognition of Taiwan since 1968 brings sustained Taiwanese infrastructure financing, medical aid, and agricultural cooperation."
